  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engagement initiative for the Strategic Partners 2022-25 / F&#xe6;lles engagementsinitiativ / SPA 22-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danes&#x2019; support for international development cooperation has increased for the first time in several years.  However, challenges remain regarding the public&#x2019;s perception of development cooperation and understanding of issues in developing countries. 
In order to maintain the high level of commitment to the international development cooperation, awareness raising and public engagement remain a priority - also in the future development policy strategy.
The objective of this project is to identify and develop a new common engagement initiative - together with the strategic partners - with the aim to inform an engage a broarder range of the Danish public in international development cooperation and SDGs.</narrative>
  </description>
